---
source: disk/tests/help_snapshots.rs
expression: "help_output(\"blockdev\")"
---
Call block device ioctls from the command line.

Each `--getXXX` or `--setXXX` command performs a single ioctl on the specified block device(s).
Multiple commands and devices can be given in a single invocation.

Usage: blockdev [-q] [-v] command [command...] device [device...]
       blockdev --report [device...]

Arguments:
  [ARGS]...
          Commands, arguments, and device paths

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
